@api = http://localhost:5090/api

### Health
GET {{api}}/health

### Public site settings + theme (used by the Angular app at start-up)
GET {{api}}/site

### Sign in (seeded Super Admin; change the password on first login)
# @name login
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@sunsteeltraders.com", "password": "<Admin:DefaultPassword>" }

### Who am I
GET {{api}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### Staff users
GET {{api}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### Change theme
PUT {{api}}/admin/theme
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "primary": "#1E2430", "accent": "#9C6B3C", "surface": "#FAF6EF" }

### Catalogue index (silos, materials, IS 808 sections, lead times, cities)
GET {{api}}/catalog

### One silo
GET {{api}}/catalog/silos/alloy-engineering-steels

### One product
GET {{api}}/catalog/products/alloy-engineering-steels/en24-chrome-moly-steel-bars

### Search (grades, names, equivalents)
GET {{api}}/catalog/search?q=4340

### City landing page
GET {{api}}/catalog/cities/tirunelveli

### Submit an RFQ (server recomputes kg: EN24 Ø80 × 500 × 4 = 78.9 kg)
POST {{api}}/leads
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "RFQ", "name": "R. Senthil", "phone": "98940 12345", "company": "Precision Lathe Works", "city": "Madurai",
  "items": [ { "productSlug": "en24-chrome-moly-steel-bars", "form": "round", "dims": { "D": 80 }, "lengthMm": 500, "quantity": 4, "cutToSize": true } ]
}

### Leads inbox
GET {{api}}/admin/leads?status=New
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### Stock board toggle
PUT {{api}}/admin/products/19/stock
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "stockStatus": "Limited" }
